OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for sex offences
OL,4,Aagainst two children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 14 years for
OL,7,Fsexual offences against two children.
OL,9,FMichael Albery, of Rodney Way,
OL,10,FWaterlooville, was found guilty at
OL,11,FPortsmouth Crown Court on 14 September
OL,12,Fof raping a girl under the age of 13.
OL,14,FThe 36-year-old was also convicted of
OL,15,Ftwo counts of causing or inciting a
OL,16,Fchild under the age of 13 to engage in
OL,17,Fsexual activity.
OL,19,FAlbery, who denied the offences, was
OL,20,Ffound guilty by a jury after a
OL,21,Fseven-day trial and was sentenced at
OL,22,Fthe same court on 30 October.
